    {
      "type": "clue",
      "id": "c_aperture",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 186,
      "props": {
        "title": "The aperture",
        "pages": [
          "A standing ring of nothing, eight feet across, held inside the containment frame.",
          "It isn't bright. Looking at it is like looking at the moment before you remember something.",
          "The air in front of it moves inward. Slowly, constantly, everything drifts toward it -- dust, my breath, the hem of my coat.",
          "Fourteen minutes into shutting it down, this pulled thirty-one people off their feet, and it is still pulling."
        ],
        "prompt": "Examine",
        "setsFlag": "clue_aperture",
        "repeatText": "Still open. Still pulling.",
        "evidence": true,
        "portrait": "worried"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "clue",
      "id": "c_badge",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 186,
      "props": {
        "title": "A badge on the floor",
        "pages": [
          "Set down flat at the very edge of the frame. Not dropped -- dropped things land badly, and this is square to the edge.",
          "VANCE, M. -- DIRECTOR. Clearance A.",
          "She put it down where anyone coming after her would have to see it. So that nobody could ever write that she was taken."
        ],
        "prompt": "Examine",
        "setsFlag": "clue_her_badge",
        "repeatText": "VANCE, M. Placed, not dropped.",
        "evidence": true,
        "portrait": "worried"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "n_final",
      "x": 930,
      "y": 186,
      "props": {
        "title": "Taped to the console",
        "pages": [
          "If you are reading this then the ring is still holding and somebody finally came, and I am sorry that it is you.",
          "Nine days. The field is stable. The dosimetry says it moved them, it did not burn them -- whatever is on the other side of this, they went into it in one piece and fourteen minutes of a shutdown ramp is not enough to kill a person.",
          "I am not going to sit at this desk for a tenth day writing down that I did nothing.",
          "Hale -- if it is you, and it will be you, because you are the only one I told to stay away and you have never once done what you were told: do not follow me in. Turn the ramp off from the panel and go back up the stairs and tell somebody.\n\nYou were late. Be late this once more.\n\n-- M."
        ],
        "prompt": "Read",
        "setsFlag": "read_vance_final",
        "once": false
      }
    },
